// The difference decider of the Ackermann lowering (include/sea/Expr/
// DiffDecider.hh, BvRange.hh; docs/design/Ackermann.md): census shapes with
// can-equal siblings (z3), the width (a 64-bit NEVER is not a k-bit one),
// leaf splitting and its budget, and seeded random terms whose every NEVER,
// ALWAYS and unsigned range z3 confirms.
RUN: sea-diff-decider-test | FileCheck %s
CHECK: test: shapes ok
CHECK: test: split ok
CHECK: test: width ok
CHECK: test: random ok
CHECK: failures: 0

